        <item>
            <title>0.18.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:48:45 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Design the four menus** — click a menu&#x27;s pill on the Compass to pick its glyph, pill colour and glyph colour; the centre hub and every place that shows the menu follow. &quot;Back to how the app ships&quot; resets it</li>
<li>**One colour picker everywhere** — presets, your saved colours, a hex field with a live preview, and the macOS colour wheel with its eyedropper</li>
<li>**Window pills tell the truth** — an app&#x27;s windows are counted from its real window list, closed chats no longer leave a ghost pill, a browser tab&#x27;s pill takes the page&#x27;s title, and the counts update the moment the ring opens</li>
<li>**Make a menu for this app** — Rayto reads an app&#x27;s commands and builds a menu from the best of them</li>
<li>**Arrange: the Library column is always the wall** — the ring stays put when you switch menus from the side panel</li>
<li>**A fast swing back through the centre closes a folder** — it used to stay open if you were quicker than a quarter second</li>
<li>**The centre hub keeps its ⌥ face while the menu closes** — no flicker back to the plain face</li>
<li>**Undo countdowns always finish** — quitting a window through the undo ring works even if you open the menu during the countdown</li>
<li>**W and S turn a floating dial** — like the arrow keys</li>
<li>**Lifetime licence** — one key, every future version</li>
<li>**Acknowledgements** — the open-source components and their licences, in the About card</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
